[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18961.59, "timestamp": "05:16:01", "text": "記録されます。 例えば、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18964.708, "timestamp": "05:16:04", "text": "あなたが悪い言葉を口にしたけれど、それを削除したとしましょう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18966.55, "timestamp": "05:16:06", "text": "例えば、すごくすごく悪い言葉だったけど、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18969.59, "timestamp": "05:16:09", "text": "それを削除したんだよね。 誰も気づかなかったけど、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18972.23, "timestamp": "05:16:12", "text": "モデレーターが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18976.55, "timestamp": "05:16:16", "text": "チャットをチェックするとき、例えば"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18979.67, "timestamp": "05:16:19", "text": "削除されたチャットとか、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18981.67, "timestamp": "05:16:21", "text": "Discord からとか、あるいは何らかの方法で、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18983.75, "timestamp": "05:16:23", "text": "すでに罰せられているのに、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18990.47, "timestamp": "05:16:30", "text": "悪い記録とかが記録されている場合。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18992.39, "timestamp": "05:16:32", "text": "ええ、それはあなたがアカウント"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18995.35, "timestamp": "05:16:35", "text": "停止処分を受けたり、相応の罰を受ける原因の一つになるでしょう。 いや、そういう感じ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18997.35, "timestamp": "05:16:37", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19002.868, "timestamp": "05:16:42", "text": "自己宣伝"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 19003.47, "timestamp": "05:16:43", "author": "@FEROCIOUS_Grrr", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/b2fcSyaRaGAEUJaW8yBs5ibxfiDi-brp1G8cHHTYAXKaRusaeuWU68kOjIUNWz1gmVNNSGP5MQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/face-purple-rain-drops"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19004.39, "timestamp": "05:16:44", "text": "や"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19009.19, "timestamp": "05:16:49", "text": "サーバーメンバーの追加、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19014.788, "timestamp": "05:16:54", "text": "自分自身"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19017.59, "timestamp": "05:16:57", "text": "や他人のDMの宣伝などに対するセキュリティ機能のようなものと言えるでしょう。"}]